{"4258540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Bunker Freak", "steam_appid": 4258540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In October 1995, a young diner worker, Chloe, went to visit a friend for a weekend trip. Halfway to her friend's house, her car broke down. With no other option, she entered an abandoned bunker for help. Little did she know that this night would become the most terrifying of her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THE BUNKER FREAK is a horror game inspired by classic 80's slasher movies and PS1 era graphics. Try to survive and escape THE BUNKER...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258540/extras/dbe7a0dc542b26aa94508152b511d2f4.poster.avif?t=1768937899\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258540/extras/dbe7a0dc542b26aa94508152b511d2f4.webm?t=1768937899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258540/extras/dbe7a0dc542b26aa94508152b511d2f4.mp4?t=1768937899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic PS1 Graphic style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80's Slasher aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying survival horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different retro camera filters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school sound design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In October 1995, a young diner worker, Chloe, went to visit a friend for a weekend trip. Halfway to her friend'